<title>SINGAPORE: International Factor suspends trading.</title>
<headline>International Factor suspends trading.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trading of finance company International Factors (Singapore) Ltd was suspended after a brief rally on Wednesday, said dealers.</p>
<p>The shares rose Singapore $0.13 to S$1.45 on a turnover of 2.05 million shares prior to suspension.</p>
<p>An official from the Stock Exchange of Singapore said the company requested the suspension pending an announcement.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
